    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>As a Magic action, you can speak the command word of this plain-looking broom and choose a point on the ground you can see within 60 feet of yourself. The broom springs to life and sweeps the dust and debris from the ground in a 20-foot square centered on that point. It keeps sweeping that area until you take another Magic action to stop it.</p>",
